Description: The Indices of Deprivation 2025 (IoD25) provide a set of relative measures of deprivation 
  for small areas (Lower-layer Super Output Areas) across England, based on seven domains of deprivation.
   Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
